Package: PLboost
Type: Package
Title: Boosting for Power Logit and Inflated Power Logit Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Luigi", "Pavarini de Lima",
                  email = "luigi.pavarini@ime.usp.br",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Gradient boosting families for the power logit (PL) class of
    distributions and its inflated extension (IPL), for regression with a
    response bounded on the unit interval. The package supplies 'Families'
    objects compatible with 'gamboostLSS', so that the median, dispersion,
    skewness and (for the inflated case) boundary-probability submodels are
    estimated jointly by component-wise gradient boosting, with variable
    selection and regularization as a by-product. It accompanies the MSc
    dissertation "Boosting-based Inference and Variable Selection for
    Modeling Bounded Continuous Data" (IME-USP).
